{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And additionally, 'to instruct.'</b> For there are many wise men who are hard put to instruct others, and here Oholiav is his associate in every craft, and also to instruct another in wisdom. Therefore it says of both of them: makers of every work and devisers of plans."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:40.056771808Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}